        ],
        "answer":"$$\\displaystyle\\int_{${:a}}^{z} \\dfrac{${:k}}{x^2}\\,dx=\\Big[-\\dfrac{${:k}}{x}\\Big]_{${:a}}^{z}=${:ka}-\\dfrac{${:k}}{z}\\;\\xrightarrow{z\\to\\infty}\\;\\color{red}{${:w}}$$",
