        "name":"Integral von k/x³ bis unendlich",
        "vars":{
            "k":"1_10",
            "a":"1_3",
            "w":"${MMmath.fractionSimplifiee(:k,2*:a*:a)}"
        },
        "question":"Berechne $$\\displaystyle\\int_{${:a}}^{\\infty} \\dfrac{${:k}}{x^3}\\,dx$$.",
        "answer":"$$\\displaystyle\\int_{${:a}}^{z} \\dfrac{${:k}}{x^3}\\,dx=\\Big[-\\dfrac{${:k}}{2x^2}\\Big]_{${:a}}^{z}=\\dfrac{${:k}}{${2*:a*:a}}-\\dfrac{${:k}}{2z^2}\\;\\xrightarrow{z\\to\\infty}\\;\\color{red}{${:w}}$$",
        "value":"${:w}"
